    "content": "round is dark blue with blurry orange and red lights. Each FAQ item has a question on the left and a yellow expand/collapse icon on the right. Questions include: \"How long does it take to design a website?\", \"Do you redesign existing websites without losing SEO?\", \"What's included in your website maintenance services?\", \"Can you design e-commerce websites?\", \"Will my website be mobile-friendly?\", \"Do you offer SEO with website design?\", and \"What if I don't like the design?\". \r\nWebsite Design FAQs \r\nWebsite Design Questions Clients Ask Before Hiring an Agency \r\nHow long does it take to design a website? \r\nOur AI-powered process delivers first drafts in 48 hours (vs. 4-6 weeks industry standard). Full launch takes 2-4 weeks, depending on revisions. \r\nDo you redesign existing websites without losing SEO? \r\nYes! Our redesigns include SEO migration audits, 301 redirects, and content preservation�zero traffic loss guaranteed. \r\nWhat�s included in your website maintenance services? \r\nOur �99",
